  "description": "Please run the ndmg pipeline using the following inputs. The diffusion\u2011weighted imaging data are located at **/data/sub-01/dwi/sub-01.nii.gz**, with the corresponding b\u2011value file **/data/sub-01/dwi/sub-01.bval** and b\u2011vector file **/data/sub-01/dwi/sub-01.bvec**. The structural T1\u2011weighted image to be used is **/data/sub-01/anat/sub-01_T1w.nii.gz**. For the anatomical reference, employ the MNI152 T1\u202f1\u202fmm atlas (**/ndmg_atlases/atlas/MNI152_T1_1mm.nii.gz**) together with its brain mask (**/ndmg_atlases/atlas/MNI152_T1_1mm_brain_mask.nii.gz**). For region labeling, select the Desikan atlas (**/ndmg_atlases/labels/desikan.nii.gz**). Direct all output to the directory **/output/sub-01**, and enable the cleaning of intermediate files (clean\u202f=\u202ftrue).",
